{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n胡楓（修哥）早前因突發急性膽管炎引發膽石堵塞，一度需入住ICU（深切治療部），情況令人擔憂。近日他在節目《一周星星》中分享康復後狀況，更豪言自己飲食百無禁忌，不料卻被身旁的老友羅蘭姐當場「篤爆」，場面溫馨又搞笑，到底羅蘭姐揭穿了修哥甚麼秘密？\n</p>\n<h2>胡楓親述膽管炎入ICU經過</h2>\n<p>在節目中，修哥坦言大病初癒後身體「仍需努力」，但他強調自己活動自如，精神不錯。他透露：「唔單止飲茶，仲可以出去應酬，不過已經推咗一啲，人多嘅地方唔去。」顯示他雖然康復進度良好，但在生活上仍相當謹慎，盡量避免到人多擠迫的地方，以免影響健康，讓一眾關心他的粉絲稍為安心。</p>\n<h2>修哥豪言咩都食遭羅蘭姐篤爆</h2>\n<p>當談及飲食習慣時，康復後的修哥中氣十足地大大聲表示：「咩嘢都食。」盡顯他樂觀開朗的本色。話音剛落，身旁的羅蘭姐隨即忍不住笑著踢爆老友真相，她模仿修哥的語氣說：「佢睇清楚菜單之後，就會話『呢個我唔食』。」修哥被老友當場篤爆揀飲擇食的秘密，流露出既尷尬又無奈的表情，兩人數十年老友鬼鬼的互動，讓現場充滿歡笑聲。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚場面溫馨又搞笑</h2>\n<p>修哥與羅蘭姐的有趣互動引來網民熱烈討論，不少人表示非常羨慕二人之間的真摯友誼。「修哥要保重身體呀！」「羅蘭姐同修哥真係好得意，老友鬼鬼！」「哈哈，畀人篤爆個樣一定好搞笑。」「呢啲先係真朋友，會直接話你！」「希望修哥健健康康，繼續帶歡樂俾我哋。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06a_10391054636af922dd6e348.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06a_10391054636af922dd6e348.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_7058549016af922e43a867.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_7058549016af922e43a867.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_6758223316af9230189ed2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_6758223316af9230189ed2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_3421220216af9231730957.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_3421220216af9231730957.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2069477686af9231e19edc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2069477686af9231e19edc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7072594896af923261a328.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7072594896af923261a328.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_10667788826af9232ad5009.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_10667788826af9232ad5009.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T20:47:50.269326+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":863,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T20:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T00:22:56.516091+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T20:40:39.416013+00:00","content_hash":"6dbba8c040fb0ca83f00d6d0785979856ccc388e6dd0315cfc34f92e99f589df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}